  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS- 9648 PPG Integrated landscape management in the Napo River Basin for sustainable land management and biodiversity conservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The objective of the project is to contribute to the integrated landscape management for sustainable land management, sustainable forest management and integrated management of water resources, through the diversification of livelihoods, improvement of the efficiency of productive systems and the conservation of ecosystems and biodiversity in the Napo River Basin.</narrative>
